   "body": "Capture result (mac/capture-batch, 2026-11-02, PR #394). **Public actions:** user1 added a two-answer poll to its own throwaway topic (https://forum.hardware.fr/hfr/Programmation/iOS/fixture-test-sujet_148785_1.htm, since deleted) by its first-post edit form (`W41`) and voted (`W42`, \"Votre vote a bien été pris en compte !\", link-less `.hop`, refresh to the topic page 1, no \"avec succès\"); the same vote again (`W43`) and from user2 (`W44`) answer \"Désolé, vous avez déjà voté !\" + back link. **Left open:** the locked-topic reply refusal (the composer of a locked topic is served, but its POST would go to a topic that is not the operator's: not sent) and a ban refusal (no banned account). Kept open with `Refs`.",
